      "writtenOn": "2021-06-17T11:38:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It probably makes sense to have the logic in virtualizationservice rather than `vm` if possible, though maybe the client can parse the VM config and pass a parcelable to virtualizationservice. Can all the files which will be part of the payload be opened by the client and passed as file descriptors?",
